# Build context of companion.Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile). The context is the repository root, which is ~34 GB
# (Unreal projects, flight artefacts, model weights) and holds the private
# signing key under policies/keys/. Everything is excluded; only the two files
# the Dockerfile copies are let back in. The code itself is mounted at run time.
*
!requirements.txt
!deploy/docker/constraints-companion.txt
!deploy/docker/entrypoint.sh
